    "As our baseline, we implemented a DeepSet architectures for both regression and classification that ignores graph structure. We try different batch sizes to improve performance while also not cause any issues during training, such as pearson correlation not being defined. This model serves as an important baseline to determine whether graph structure provides meaningful signal beyond node features alone."
