  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "source": [
    "We implemented GCN based on Kipf & Welling [2], using the layer-wise propagation rule:\n",
    "$H^{(l+1)} = \u03c3(D\u0303^{-1/2} \\tilde{A} D\u0303^{-1/2} H^{(l)} W^{(l)})$\n",
    "\n",
    "where $\\tilde{A} = A + I_N$ is the adjacency matrix with self-connections and $D\u0303$ is the corresponding degree matrix. This formulation provides an efficient first-order approximation of spectral graph convolutions.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "id": "TU461EndOzHR"
   }
  },
